senses.gloss:
सैनिक, अस्, ई, अम्, relating or belonging to an
army, military, martial, drawn up in martial array;
(अस्), m. an army-man, soldier; a guard, sentinel;
a body of forces in array.

सैंहल सैंहल, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. सिंहल), be-
longing to Ceylon; produced or growing in Ceylon;
(ई), f. a kind of plant (= सिंह-पिप्पली).
